WEBVTT

01:29.700 --> 01:31.620
[Blood River]

01:31.620 --> 01:33.980
[Based on the novel of the same name from Zhou Munan's Youth in Jianghu series]

01:33.980 --> 01:35.980
[Available on fanqienovel.com & bkneng.com]

01:36.260 --> 01:39.020
[Episode 26]

02:01.230 --> 02:02.050
Senior.

02:02.560 --> 02:03.570
You've spent all these years

02:03.640 --> 02:05.620
practicing martial arts, huh?

02:06.870 --> 02:07.900
To save lives,

02:08.960 --> 02:10.410
a physician must know how to protect himself first.

02:11.630 --> 02:12.660
Senior.

02:13.630 --> 02:15.940
What a pity. You're being naive.

02:30.360 --> 02:32.060
Senior, oh, senior.

02:33.560 --> 02:35.060
I never thought

02:35.840 --> 02:38.010
you'd end up falling into my hands.

02:39.430 --> 02:40.450
Do we kill him now?

02:41.560 --> 02:42.610
Take him back to the Tang Clan first.

02:56.020 --> 03:00.180
[He-Yu Clinic]

03:17.710 --> 03:18.560
My good girl.

03:19.190 --> 03:19.730
Come.

03:20.360 --> 03:21.130
Let's go to the lantern festival.

03:25.840 --> 03:27.220
Why has this courtyard

03:28.030 --> 03:29.430
been quiet

03:29.430 --> 03:30.260
since Su Muyu's departure?

03:34.750 --> 03:36.450
Where is that cheerful daughter of mine?

03:39.190 --> 03:40.060
I just think

03:40.910 --> 03:41.820
Su Muyu

03:42.520 --> 03:43.730
tends to overthink

03:44.360 --> 03:45.890
and keep things to himself.

03:47.080 --> 03:48.290
And he's fine

03:48.590 --> 03:49.610
making himself mentally exhausted.

03:51.960 --> 03:53.500
Compared to Su Changhe,

03:54.590 --> 03:56.060
Su Muyu isn't half bad.

03:58.910 --> 04:00.610
You could figure out what's on Su Muyu's mind,

04:01.030 --> 04:02.030
but you would never do the same

04:02.030 --> 04:03.170
to Su Changhe.

04:04.470 --> 04:05.130
I could never,

04:05.750 --> 04:06.730
and I don't get my head around it.

04:07.840 --> 04:08.940
Just like now.

04:10.360 --> 04:11.500
I just don't get it.

04:12.560 --> 04:13.220
Why

04:14.360 --> 04:15.660
did we part ways

04:16.480 --> 04:17.810
time and time again?

04:19.950 --> 04:20.700
My silly daughter.

04:21.310 --> 04:23.020
You're never meant to be.

04:25.950 --> 04:26.980
They belong to the Blood River.

04:28.160 --> 04:29.370
Though

04:29.750 --> 04:31.080
you've seen each other

04:31.120 --> 04:31.930
as friends,

04:32.360 --> 04:33.660
they're Blood River members after all.

04:34.310 --> 04:35.980
The Blood River remains

04:36.390 --> 04:37.370
unacceptable in this world.

04:41.560 --> 04:43.370
It's not that they don't see you as a friend.

04:43.950 --> 04:44.660
It's just that...

04:48.800 --> 04:49.780
They don't want

04:49.870 --> 04:51.220
to get you involved

04:52.600 --> 04:53.580
when they're in danger.

04:57.560 --> 04:58.100
There, there.

04:58.630 --> 04:59.410
Don't be sad.

05:24.680 --> 05:25.410
Jin City

05:26.070 --> 05:26.930
is a nice place.

05:28.480 --> 05:30.170
Mount Wangcheng is nearby.

05:30.920 --> 05:32.140
Don't you want to meet

05:32.390 --> 05:33.610
that Taoist you admire?

05:33.670 --> 05:34.210
Well...

05:34.680 --> 05:35.410
Forget it.

05:35.920 --> 05:36.410
After all,

05:36.720 --> 05:38.170
the idea of Master Mu paying the Wangchengshan Sect a visit

05:38.430 --> 05:40.100
sounds rather frightening.

05:47.680 --> 05:48.780
Turns out Master Mu

05:49.480 --> 05:50.850
is a young lad.

05:51.120 --> 05:51.660
Looks like

05:52.160 --> 05:53.660
we can't visit the Wangchengshan Sect even if we want to.

05:53.950 --> 05:55.290
Our friend from the Tang Clan is here.

05:55.920 --> 05:56.780
I don't think we're friends yet.

05:56.830 --> 05:57.980
There's no telling what.

06:06.040 --> 06:06.730
Death Summons, huh?

06:07.510 --> 06:08.620
Is this how the Tang Clan

06:08.620 --> 06:09.540
entertains a guest?

06:16.920 --> 06:18.050
Since this is your turf,

06:18.620 --> 06:19.910
why must you

06:20.160 --> 06:21.290
hide your faces

06:21.950 --> 06:23.140
in our presence?

06:23.720 --> 06:24.580
Where is Tang Linghuang?

06:25.270 --> 06:26.460
He agreed to see us.

06:27.120 --> 06:28.660
Even if he left the city to greet us in advance,

06:29.160 --> 06:30.340
why isn't he here?

06:31.430 --> 06:32.540
What makes you think

06:32.750 --> 06:34.140
that I'm not Tang Linghuang?

06:35.920 --> 06:37.340
If you were Tang Linghuang,

06:37.830 --> 06:40.020
this peach wood sword of mine

06:41.270 --> 06:43.050
would've turned to dust now.

06:45.270 --> 06:46.850
Are you saying

06:47.270 --> 06:48.460
that I'm less than him?

06:49.040 --> 06:50.020
I never said so.

06:51.040 --> 06:51.700
Xuewei.

07:01.000 --> 07:02.700
How dare you try to poison us.

07:03.480 --> 07:04.580
How pathetic.

07:05.240 --> 07:05.850
Pathetic?

07:07.000 --> 07:08.730
My family has practiced dark arts for years.

07:09.360 --> 07:10.370
When it comes to using poison,

07:10.920 --> 07:11.980
we're as good as

07:12.120 --> 07:12.780
your clan.

07:21.830 --> 07:22.490
Activate the array.

07:31.920 --> 07:34.100
The poisonous fog opens the gates to the underworld.

07:34.630 --> 07:36.340
Through the art of sigils, the true flame is revealed.

07:44.480 --> 07:45.850
That's the Tang Clan's Fourfold Blackwater Formation.

07:47.630 --> 07:48.930
Trying to use your poison in the presence of Poisonous Blossom?

07:49.830 --> 07:50.610
Ridiculous.

07:52.430 --> 07:54.220
This is awe-inspiring.

07:54.600 --> 07:55.410
This lady

07:56.040 --> 07:57.280
has managed to refine

07:57.280 --> 07:59.170
her poisoning technique to such an exquisite state.

07:59.310 --> 08:00.100
Poisoning technique?

08:01.070 --> 08:02.290
It's more than that.

08:02.920 --> 08:04.250
I bet this will

08:04.510 --> 08:06.460
get more interesting.

08:19.870 --> 08:20.900
Mister.

08:21.510 --> 08:23.250
Our presence here means no harm.

08:23.920 --> 08:24.980
Why must you

08:25.000 --> 08:25.730
resort to violence?

08:26.190 --> 08:27.540
You're from the Blood River,

08:28.070 --> 08:29.730
so there's nothing good.

08:30.310 --> 08:31.170
I got it now.

08:31.830 --> 08:32.700
That lady

08:33.080 --> 08:33.940
is a poisonous person.

08:35.200 --> 08:36.580
I never expected the Mu family of Blood River

08:36.790 --> 08:37.610
would manage to train

08:37.750 --> 08:38.980
such a poisonous person.

08:39.440 --> 08:40.940
That's Poisonous Blossom from the Blood River.

08:44.910 --> 08:45.700
I want her.

08:48.510 --> 08:49.180
I get it now.

08:50.200 --> 08:50.820
The Tang Clan

08:51.440 --> 08:52.890
is under someone else's control.

08:53.440 --> 08:54.890
That's why you're not happy

08:55.790 --> 08:56.700
about our presence here.

08:57.120 --> 08:57.820
Nonsense!

09:19.480 --> 09:21.010
My body is all poisonous.

09:21.390 --> 09:22.890
You sure are courting death.

09:26.840 --> 09:27.610
What's going on?

09:29.150 --> 09:29.980
Mu Qingyang!

09:30.840 --> 09:31.490
Xuewei!

09:59.030 --> 09:59.940
Blood blooms beneath the skin.

10:00.510 --> 10:01.220
A single cut means instant death.

10:01.630 --> 10:02.650
Why do they remain unharmed?

10:02.960 --> 10:03.530
Could it be

10:04.120 --> 10:04.730
that there are poisonous persons like Xuewei

10:05.320 --> 10:06.650
in the Tang Clan?

10:07.480 --> 10:08.100
I get it.

10:08.870 --> 10:09.610
Both of them

10:10.120 --> 10:10.890
are the drugged puppets

10:10.910 --> 10:11.980
mentioned in Patriarch's letter!

10:17.870 --> 10:18.530
They're numb.

10:18.960 --> 10:19.580
They show no fear.

10:20.550 --> 10:21.250
And they're immune to all poisons.

10:22.150 --> 10:22.940
I see it now!

10:26.120 --> 10:26.850
Xuewei!

10:34.200 --> 10:35.490
How rare.

10:37.750 --> 10:39.180
I never thought there'd be

10:39.750 --> 10:41.730
such a perfect poisonous person in this world.

10:42.360 --> 10:43.060
Who are you?

10:44.030 --> 10:45.530
You'll find out soon.

10:46.200 --> 10:46.980
Take her away.

10:49.550 --> 10:50.370
Xuewei!

11:11.390 --> 11:13.180
Never underestimate the Tang Clan.

11:21.720 --> 11:22.370
My good daughter.

11:25.750 --> 11:26.890
Where did this little white snake come from?

11:28.630 --> 11:29.490
That's a Death-Chasing Serpent.

11:34.720 --> 11:35.650
Death-Chasing Serpent?

11:40.120 --> 11:41.340
Every disciple of the Medicine King Valley

11:41.710 --> 11:43.410
keeps one for protection.

11:43.670 --> 11:45.250
When faced with deadly danger,

11:45.420 --> 11:47.400
we secretly release the Death-Chasing Serpent.

11:47.750 --> 11:49.470
It will crawl over mountains and rivers,

11:49.470 --> 11:50.400
traveling all the way

11:50.630 --> 11:52.850
to find another disciple of the Valley.

11:53.270 --> 11:54.180
I never knew about that.

11:55.790 --> 11:56.700
Baicao

11:57.320 --> 11:58.460
is always such a cautious one.

11:59.200 --> 12:01.490
Could he have fallen into danger?

12:05.740 --> 12:08.980
[Jin City]

12:10.910 --> 12:12.940
"Heaven parts once to birth the mortal realm.

12:13.390 --> 12:15.530
From a thousand trees and rivers, life begins anew.

12:16.670 --> 12:18.490
Grass, woods, and clouds all tinted violet.

12:19.080 --> 12:21.850
Even wind and moon can't touch its wild grace."

12:22.720 --> 12:24.100
That poem was written

12:24.120 --> 12:24.890
by your favorite Sword Poet Deity.

12:25.270 --> 12:26.770
It describes Jin City itself.

12:27.960 --> 12:29.460
Now that you've stepped into it,

12:30.030 --> 12:30.850
how do you feel?

12:32.510 --> 12:33.370
I've been here

12:33.870 --> 12:35.180
many years ago.

12:37.150 --> 12:37.890
What were you here for?

12:39.360 --> 12:40.890
I was the Umbrella Ghost of the Blood River then.

12:41.480 --> 12:42.340
What else could it have been for?

12:44.120 --> 12:44.940
I see.

12:49.820 --> 12:51.540
[Jingsi Teahouse]

13:06.000 --> 13:07.460
What are they doing, Su Muyu?

13:07.840 --> 13:08.580
Do you get it?

13:09.030 --> 13:09.650
Thirty Thousand.

13:10.120 --> 13:10.700
Four Bamboos.

13:11.320 --> 13:12.340
It's called Mahjong.

13:12.870 --> 13:14.370
It's very popular here in Jin City.

13:14.600 --> 13:15.900
They drink tea and play mahjong,

13:15.910 --> 13:16.870
or pull up a stool

13:17.000 --> 13:18.450
and gather around for a "Dragon Gate Array" session.

13:19.120 --> 13:20.730
That's daily life for the people of Jin City.

13:21.440 --> 13:22.610
Dragon Gate Array?

13:23.360 --> 13:24.610
Is that some powerful formation?

13:26.630 --> 13:28.010
Well, you could say that.

13:28.480 --> 13:30.500
Their posture when gathered together

13:30.910 --> 13:32.510
looks just like General Xue of the old dynasty

13:32.510 --> 13:33.850
when he encircled the northern tribes.

13:36.270 --> 13:38.380
But with Tang Clan guarding inside Jin City

13:38.400 --> 13:39.700
and Wangchengshan Sect defending the outside,

13:39.740 --> 13:41.300
peace has reigned for years.

13:41.620 --> 13:42.790
Why would Jin City folk

13:43.000 --> 13:44.370
need to set up any "Dragon Gate Array"?

13:45.550 --> 13:47.180
It's just a saying.

13:47.960 --> 13:49.340
They just gather to gossip

13:50.390 --> 13:52.460
about whatever's been happening lately.

13:55.150 --> 13:57.220
So basically, they're just bragging together.

13:58.910 --> 13:59.420
Su Muyu.

14:00.120 --> 14:01.940
Why is it that I'm the one asking questions,

14:02.240 --> 14:03.100
and you're answering them?

14:03.910 --> 14:05.700
Have we switched roles all of a sudden?

14:06.670 --> 14:07.490
Wasn't it you

14:07.510 --> 14:08.530
who always knew nothing

14:08.870 --> 14:09.580
about stuff?

14:12.030 --> 14:13.770
Back then, to deal with a powerful enemy,

14:14.840 --> 14:16.650
I stayed in Jin City for three whole months.

14:17.240 --> 14:18.770
So I got to know this place quite well.

14:19.510 --> 14:19.980
Mahjong!

14:27.750 --> 14:28.730
That means you've won, right?

14:29.480 --> 14:30.340
Of course I have.

14:30.630 --> 14:32.700
[Lei Yunhe, Lei Clan]
128 points in total! Pay up!

14:34.030 --> 14:35.820
That's sheer luck, brat.

14:36.000 --> 14:36.850
Come on, again!

14:37.510 --> 14:38.220
Still playing?

14:38.630 --> 14:40.060
Who are you? We're in a game!

14:40.480 --> 14:41.130
We have no time to entertain you.

14:42.790 --> 14:43.580
Master Mu.

14:43.790 --> 14:44.490
You brat!

14:45.720 --> 14:46.460
What's that supposed to mean?

14:47.080 --> 14:47.890
Is he insulting me?

14:48.200 --> 14:49.010
That's the slang here.

14:49.440 --> 14:50.610
He was just greeting you warmly.

15:01.360 --> 15:01.980
How funny.

15:03.030 --> 15:04.530
This gentleman sure is full of humor.

15:05.670 --> 15:06.130
Brat.

15:16.320 --> 15:18.100
If you hadn't sounded so sincere,

15:19.670 --> 15:21.420
I'd have thought you were provoking me.

15:29.600 --> 15:30.180
Master Mu.

15:31.080 --> 15:32.300
Is that how you greet people here?

15:36.440 --> 15:38.700
Patriarch and Master Su.

15:39.030 --> 15:40.100
Why didn't you inform me of your presence here

15:40.120 --> 15:40.980
in advance?

15:41.240 --> 15:42.490
I could have made preparations early.

15:43.240 --> 15:43.980
This friend of mine

15:44.630 --> 15:46.300
stayed in Jin City for three months then.

15:46.910 --> 15:47.890
You were the one who hosted him, weren't you?

15:48.750 --> 15:49.220
Yes.

15:49.480 --> 15:50.250
Yes, yes.

15:50.910 --> 15:53.220
So you taught him to greet people

15:53.910 --> 15:55.820
by calling them brat?

15:56.670 --> 15:57.180
Well...

15:57.670 --> 15:57.980
Well...

15:58.120 --> 16:00.120
[Master Mu, Jin City Mole]
I was only joking

16:00.120 --> 16:00.980
with Master Su.

16:01.120 --> 16:02.440
I didn't expect Master Su

16:02.440 --> 16:03.130
would take it seriously.

16:03.270 --> 16:04.390
After that, I...

16:04.390 --> 16:05.220
I...

16:05.270 --> 16:07.370
I didn't explain it.

16:07.750 --> 16:09.010
No wonder Liu Yilong seemed so furious

16:09.080 --> 16:10.100
when I was having a duel with him

16:10.510 --> 16:11.730
then.

16:12.910 --> 16:14.060
That's actually an insult, huh?

16:16.910 --> 16:18.060
Pardon me, I...

16:19.960 --> 16:21.130
Because you always acted like

16:21.200 --> 16:22.370
a polite assassin?

16:22.870 --> 16:24.370
You even greet people before killing them.

16:25.390 --> 16:26.340
I bet Liu Yilong was so mad

16:26.750 --> 16:27.700
that he couldn't even hold his sword well

16:27.750 --> 16:29.180
when you called him that.

16:33.670 --> 16:34.650
That's enough.

16:35.870 --> 16:36.610
All right, I'll stop laughing.

16:38.370 --> 16:40.420
You mood changes faster than the weather here in Jin City.

16:44.550 --> 16:45.130
Master Mu.

16:45.790 --> 16:46.420
Yes, sir.

16:47.120 --> 16:49.340
You said we came

16:49.340 --> 16:50.340
without notice.

16:51.550 --> 16:52.530
I was wrong.

16:53.120 --> 16:54.420
Patriarch, Master Su.

16:54.440 --> 16:55.100
With your status,

16:55.240 --> 16:56.220
you can come and go as you please.

16:56.360 --> 16:57.770
Why would you inform me of it?

16:58.120 --> 16:58.890
That was a slip of the tongue.

16:59.240 --> 16:59.850
That was a slip of the tongue.

16:59.870 --> 17:00.420
I misspoke.

17:00.720 --> 17:01.250
No.

17:02.030 --> 17:02.650
What I mean is

17:02.960 --> 17:03.940
I already told you so long ago.

17:04.480 --> 17:05.330
In fact,

17:05.350 --> 17:05.900
they've been waiting here

17:06.270 --> 17:06.900
for us too.

17:07.440 --> 17:08.140
Them?

17:10.400 --> 17:11.010
Who?

17:11.790 --> 17:12.810
One is Mu Xuewei.

17:13.480 --> 17:14.180
Poisonous Blossom?

17:14.480 --> 17:14.980
As the other one,

17:15.790 --> 17:17.020
you haven't met him

17:17.020 --> 17:17.930
after years of being stationed here in Jin City.

17:18.200 --> 17:18.870
However,

17:18.960 --> 17:20.360
he's now your family head.

17:20.640 --> 17:21.490
And that's Mu Qingyang.

17:24.790 --> 17:25.460
Well...

17:26.880 --> 17:28.050
You haven't seen them before?

17:28.880 --> 17:29.490
I swear.

17:29.680 --> 17:30.940
I really haven't seen them.

17:31.160 --> 17:32.530
If Mu family head

17:32.790 --> 17:33.770
ever came to my teahouse,

17:33.960 --> 17:35.090
how could I not know?

17:45.030 --> 17:46.380
The situation looks bad.

17:48.070 --> 17:49.420
I'd say it's very bad.

17:50.480 --> 17:50.980
Changhe.

17:51.310 --> 17:52.010
Where is Yumo?

17:52.830 --> 17:53.510
Before entering the city,

17:53.510 --> 17:54.570
she was still with us.

17:55.440 --> 17:56.140
Yumo

17:56.550 --> 17:57.660
went ahead of us

17:57.790 --> 17:58.530
and infiltrated the Tang Clan.

17:59.110 --> 18:00.050
She infiltrated the Tang Clan?

18:05.110 --> 18:07.220
They say Tang Fort is nothing but dangerous.

18:08.270 --> 18:09.570
But it doesn't seem hard to get into it.

18:14.310 --> 18:15.070
[Tang Lian]
Who's that? How dare you intrude upon

18:15.090 --> 18:16.570
[Disciple of Tang Lianyue]
Tang Clan's forbidden grounds.

18:17.960 --> 18:19.180
So it's a young boy.

18:25.830 --> 18:27.130
You're pretty agile.

18:27.590 --> 18:28.180
Don't move.

18:28.860 --> 18:29.710
Stay still

18:29.960 --> 18:30.900
or don't blame me

18:30.900 --> 18:32.140
for being merciless.

18:32.680 --> 18:33.620
Who exactly are you?

18:36.200 --> 18:37.290
That Fingertip Blade of yours seems nice.

18:37.880 --> 18:39.730
And it looks somewhat familiar to me.

18:40.680 --> 18:41.330
Who taught you that?

18:43.440 --> 18:44.420
Why do you ask?

18:47.880 --> 18:48.940
Are you threatening me?

18:54.070 --> 18:55.320
I actually figured it out.

18:55.680 --> 18:57.280
You're Tang Lianyue's disciple,

18:57.400 --> 18:57.940
aren't you?

18:58.640 --> 18:59.570
How do you know that?

19:00.830 --> 19:01.490
I knew it.

19:02.680 --> 19:04.250
Like master,

19:04.590 --> 19:06.250
like disciple.

19:07.350 --> 19:08.250
How foolish.

19:09.070 --> 19:10.460
I just probed into it,

19:10.920 --> 19:11.940
and you told me everything.

19:12.440 --> 19:13.090
You tricked me?

19:13.790 --> 19:15.290
You just asked me a question.

19:15.590 --> 19:17.050
You asked who I am.

19:18.830 --> 19:20.570
I can tell you now.

19:21.310 --> 19:22.220
I am...

19:23.960 --> 19:25.090
your master's future wife.

19:25.350 --> 19:25.980
What?

19:26.680 --> 19:27.050
You...

19:30.160 --> 19:31.490
Do you want to get everyone here?

19:34.070 --> 19:34.660
Rest assured.

19:35.070 --> 19:36.180
Do I look like a bad person?

19:36.590 --> 19:37.730
I really am your master's wife.

19:40.550 --> 19:41.330
However...

19:42.920 --> 19:43.770
Would someone like my master

19:44.000 --> 19:45.460
have a woman he adores?

19:49.480 --> 19:51.290
But even if he did have one,

19:52.550 --> 19:54.010
he wouldn't tell us for sure.

19:54.510 --> 19:56.180
What an adorable disciple.

19:56.960 --> 19:57.940
What nonsense are you saying?

19:59.480 --> 19:59.980
All right.

20:00.480 --> 20:00.980
Well,

20:01.160 --> 20:01.940
what's your name?

20:02.680 --> 20:03.420
My name is Tang Lian.

20:03.750 --> 20:04.570
Lian, as in lotus flower.

20:05.720 --> 20:07.090
Your master is Tang Lianyue,

20:07.400 --> 20:08.420
and you're Tang Lian.

20:09.550 --> 20:10.330
How amusing.

20:11.480 --> 20:12.460
Tell me where he is.

20:12.790 --> 20:13.740
Take me to him.

20:14.320 --> 20:14.900
Wait!

20:16.640 --> 20:18.540
Even if my master has someone he loves,

20:18.680 --> 20:20.200
what proof do you have

20:20.200 --> 20:21.260
that you're the one?

20:21.750 --> 20:22.860
You need proof for that?

20:26.200 --> 20:26.730
Fine.

20:35.310 --> 20:35.980
Looks familiar, doesn't it?

20:36.720 --> 20:37.980
That's Master's Fingertip Blade!

20:39.400 --> 20:39.900
Yes.

20:40.270 --> 20:41.660
Your master gave it to me.

20:42.400 --> 20:43.120
He said

20:43.480 --> 20:45.010
it was our token of affection.

20:46.200 --> 20:47.090
Do you believe me now?

20:47.920 --> 20:48.980
Surely you don't think

20:49.510 --> 20:50.250
a weak woman

20:50.270 --> 20:51.290
like me

20:52.030 --> 20:53.490
could have seized his personal weapon

20:53.640 --> 20:55.220
by force, do you?

20:55.590 --> 20:56.250
But...

20:58.830 --> 20:59.660
Mistress.

21:02.160 --> 21:03.900
My master has been in seclusion lately.

21:04.110 --> 21:05.420
Even I haven't seen him for a long time.

21:07.310 --> 21:08.010
Seclusion?

21:09.510 --> 21:10.980
After entering the Lianyue Pavilion,

21:10.980 --> 21:12.000
he hasn't come out since then.

21:12.790 --> 21:14.070
Martial Uncle said

21:14.070 --> 21:15.010
that he went into seclusion to cultivate.

21:16.200 --> 21:16.860
Right there.

21:19.920 --> 21:21.660
He's in seclusion because he doesn't know I'm here.

21:22.480 --> 21:23.290
He'll show himself

21:23.640 --> 21:24.490
if I go to him.

21:25.830 --> 21:26.730
That won't do, Mistress.

21:27.160 --> 21:28.880
There are two inner-hall martial uncles guarding outside the Lianyue Pavilion.

21:29.160 --> 21:30.380
They're always strict when it comes to that,

21:30.750 --> 21:32.530
even though you're close to Master.

21:33.440 --> 21:35.090
I've asked to see Master several times,

21:35.090 --> 21:35.940
but I was always turned away.

21:39.310 --> 21:39.980
Is that so?

21:41.790 --> 21:42.460
Mistress!

21:42.880 --> 21:43.570
Mistress.

21:50.030 --> 21:51.420
There's certainly something off

21:51.750 --> 21:52.570
about Uncle Fulu and Uncle Tianlu.

21:54.440 --> 21:55.090
What do you mean?

21:56.240 --> 21:57.420
By seniority, those two

21:57.720 --> 21:59.010
are considered Master's elders.

21:59.400 --> 22:00.460
Why would they be guarding for him?

22:01.310 --> 22:02.730
Only one of them did that.

22:03.270 --> 22:05.380
Now both of them are here...

22:07.200 --> 22:08.010
Could it be

22:09.270 --> 22:10.050
that Master...

22:11.880 --> 22:12.570
I'll go check on it.

22:15.000 --> 22:15.660
Mistress!

22:17.070 --> 22:17.700
Who's there?

22:31.750 --> 22:32.380
Uncle Tianlu.

22:33.070 --> 22:34.090
You're here too, Uncle Fulu.

22:35.680 --> 22:37.050
It's you, Tang Lian.

22:38.000 --> 22:38.810
Can't sleep again?

22:40.030 --> 22:40.700
I'm missing my master,

22:41.030 --> 22:41.770
so I'm here to have a look.

22:42.880 --> 22:44.420
Your master is in seclusion.

22:45.440 --> 22:46.090
Looks like

22:47.070 --> 22:48.140
this seclusion of his

22:48.160 --> 22:48.860
is truly important.

22:49.510 --> 22:50.700
Martial Uncles, thank you

22:50.920 --> 22:51.860
for staying up to guard him.

22:57.640 --> 22:58.220
Fulu.

22:59.070 --> 23:00.490
There was some noise above just now.

23:01.160 --> 23:01.860
I'll go check on it.

23:08.640 --> 23:09.620
What is he trying to do?

23:24.270 --> 23:24.810
Stop!

23:39.960 --> 23:40.490
This is…

23:43.270 --> 23:43.940
Tang Lianyue.

23:45.590 --> 23:46.250
Master!

23:50.240 --> 23:50.940
Master.

23:51.400 --> 23:52.220
How could this be?

23:53.510 --> 23:54.220
This is…

23:57.830 --> 23:58.700
Who are you?

24:14.160 --> 24:14.660
Go!

24:14.960 --> 24:15.700
Get help!

24:16.000 --> 24:16.980
You must wait for my return.

24:29.830 --> 24:30.380
No.

24:31.880 --> 24:33.250
Why not?

24:37.310 --> 24:37.980
No matter

24:39.110 --> 24:40.220
how gifted the brat is,

24:41.070 --> 24:42.570
he's as temperamental as his master.

24:42.960 --> 24:43.570
Now

24:44.400 --> 24:46.530
he already knows his master is trapped by us.

24:47.790 --> 24:48.660
We can't let him live.

24:49.110 --> 24:49.770
Hold on.

24:52.350 --> 24:53.460
Only he and Tang Linghuang know

24:53.790 --> 24:55.180
where the hidden weapons vault is.

24:55.790 --> 24:57.260
Before we figure that out,

24:58.110 --> 24:59.460
Madam won't let us kill him.

25:02.030 --> 25:03.460
Tang Lian is his only disciple

25:04.110 --> 25:05.220
as well as his weakness.

25:16.510 --> 25:17.050
Tianlu.

25:18.200 --> 25:18.980
Lock him up

25:19.070 --> 25:19.940
somewhere for now.

25:20.270 --> 25:21.520
I'll go report to Madam

25:21.640 --> 25:22.460
about what just happened.

25:33.200 --> 25:33.860
I'm back.

25:35.510 --> 25:35.940
Well,

25:36.160 --> 25:36.940
what did you find?

25:37.200 --> 25:37.860
I snuck into the Tang Clan

25:38.200 --> 25:39.330
and ran into Tang Lianyue's young disciple,

25:39.350 --> 25:39.900
Tang Lian.

25:40.000 --> 25:40.490
Only then did I learn

25:41.000 --> 25:42.620
that Tang Lianyue has been trapped in the Lianyue Pavilion.

25:42.960 --> 25:43.770
To protect me,

25:44.070 --> 25:44.770
Tang Lian was caught

25:44.790 --> 25:45.530
by Tang Tianlu and Tang Fulu.

25:45.880 --> 25:47.090
We must go back and rescue them.

25:48.030 --> 25:49.220
Don't panic, Yumo.

25:49.880 --> 25:50.700
Tell me more about it.

25:51.480 --> 25:52.260
Some unknown thing

25:52.260 --> 25:53.630
has frozen Tang Lianyue solid.

25:54.000 --> 25:54.620
Within three chi,

25:54.790 --> 25:56.310
no living thing can approach me.

25:56.960 --> 25:57.700
It's the Frostmoon Cocoon.

25:58.350 --> 25:59.900
Miss Bai ever brought that up.

26:00.310 --> 26:01.140
It's extremely rare,

26:02.110 --> 26:03.560
but it can instantly freeze

26:03.560 --> 26:04.480
even a master.

26:05.240 --> 26:06.130
However, it doesn't last forever.

26:06.790 --> 26:08.420
Perhaps they're there every day to replenish its effect,

26:08.590 --> 26:10.070
keeping Tang Lianyue under control long-term.

26:10.400 --> 26:11.530
As for why they don't kill him,

26:12.270 --> 26:13.290
maybe they need

26:13.830 --> 26:15.250
something from him.

26:16.070 --> 26:16.700
Maybe

26:17.030 --> 26:18.180
Qingyang and Xuewei

26:18.720 --> 26:19.700
are inside the Tang Clan too.

26:20.510 --> 26:21.330
Has something happened

26:21.960 --> 26:22.770
to Qingyang and Xuewei?

26:24.000 --> 26:24.660
Yes.

26:25.960 --> 26:27.010
The Tang Clan

26:27.680 --> 26:29.250
is truly a hostile place.

26:30.160 --> 26:30.980
Although it's dangerous,

26:31.880 --> 26:33.290
we must enter the Tang Clan again.

26:34.400 --> 26:35.010
However, we need

26:35.030 --> 26:36.180
to come up with a thorough plan first.

26:41.350 --> 26:42.840
Those we sent to Jin City

26:42.960 --> 26:43.940
haven't returned yet?

26:44.350 --> 26:44.860
No.

26:45.640 --> 26:46.420
We've lost contact

26:46.880 --> 26:48.540
with both the new envoys

26:49.000 --> 26:50.220
and the disciples stationed in Jin City.

26:51.590 --> 26:53.220
We could still send Xuanwu Guardian missives then.

26:53.550 --> 26:55.980
Now, even that's impossible.

26:56.720 --> 26:57.530
So we believe

26:58.110 --> 26:58.940
something major

26:59.510 --> 27:00.810
is about to happen in Jin City.

27:02.510 --> 27:04.010
If that's the case,

27:04.790 --> 27:05.860
it must be tied to the Tang Clan.

27:09.270 --> 27:11.180
What happens in the Tang Clan is a martial affair.

27:11.550 --> 27:13.660
It has little to do with the Baixiao Hall.

27:14.200 --> 27:14.660
Yet

27:15.160 --> 27:16.180
Tang Lianyue

27:16.270 --> 27:17.380
from the Tang Clan

27:17.550 --> 27:18.380
is my close friend.

27:19.270 --> 27:20.660
He's a man of principle,

27:21.310 --> 27:22.490
so why hasn't he returned to Tianqi City

27:22.960 --> 27:25.010
to report in a long time?

27:25.960 --> 27:26.900
If the Tang Clan changes,

27:27.400 --> 27:28.860
the entire martial world will change.

27:29.160 --> 27:30.460
Any word from the Blood River?

27:31.070 --> 27:32.250
Su Changhe, Su Muyu, and the rest

27:32.790 --> 27:33.860
are already in Jin City.

27:34.440 --> 27:36.140
However, we haven't heard from them

27:36.680 --> 27:37.700
since then.

27:39.240 --> 27:40.140
Just relying on the Blood River

27:40.270 --> 27:41.460
won't put my mind at ease.

27:41.880 --> 27:42.620
We need to send

27:43.200 --> 27:44.660
someone capable and reliable

27:45.070 --> 27:46.810
to the Tang Clan.

27:46.940 --> 27:48.120
[Tang Clan is in turmoil.]

27:48.150 --> 27:49.340
[Second City Lord, please go check on it on Guardian Azure Dragon's behalf. Ji.]

27:54.960 --> 27:55.810
What a hassle.

28:22.400 --> 28:23.010
It's been days.

28:23.760 --> 28:25.570
These Tang Clan men just won't give up.

28:26.160 --> 28:26.770
Could it be

28:28.350 --> 28:29.460
this is where my life ends?

28:33.920 --> 28:34.490
Go.

28:35.510 --> 28:37.010
If there are any Blood River disciples in Jin City,

28:37.360 --> 28:38.220
come to my rescue!

28:46.350 --> 28:47.180
He's over there!

28:47.680 --> 28:48.140
Give chase!

29:13.440 --> 29:14.730
Looks like you're here

29:14.750 --> 29:15.700
after being chased by your enemy.

29:17.310 --> 29:17.770
Are you

29:18.200 --> 29:19.420
from the Wangchengshan Sect?

29:20.510 --> 29:21.530
Wangchengshan Sect?

29:26.480 --> 29:28.290
Do I look like a Taoist to you?

29:29.240 --> 29:29.810
Li.

29:31.070 --> 29:32.250
Do I look like one?

29:40.240 --> 29:40.810
Mister.

29:41.510 --> 29:42.050
Saving a life

29:42.350 --> 29:43.490
is a sacred act.

29:48.510 --> 29:49.380
I have many rare treasures,

29:49.590 --> 29:50.530
and I can trade them with you.

29:52.000 --> 29:52.940
I'm not interested in that.

29:53.480 --> 29:54.530
Just tell me

29:55.030 --> 29:56.380
who your enemy is.

30:01.680 --> 30:02.290
It's the Tang Clan.

30:03.640 --> 30:04.490
Tang Clan?

30:09.750 --> 30:10.770
You're in luck.

30:11.750 --> 30:12.730
I won't ask your name

30:12.880 --> 30:13.730
or where you're from.

30:14.270 --> 30:15.250
If the Tang Clan wants you dead,

30:16.030 --> 30:17.090
I'll save you.

30:23.550 --> 30:24.180
Get on.

30:28.510 --> 30:29.090
Where do you think you're running?

30:30.270 --> 30:31.660
Thunder shakes the heavens and earth.

30:32.030 --> 30:34.050
One strike splits the sky for ninety thousand miles!

31:15.000 --> 31:16.250
Thank you for saving me.

31:18.070 --> 31:18.940
Aren't you curious why I saved you

31:18.960 --> 31:20.690
at the mention of the Tang Clan?

31:22.270 --> 31:23.140
If you don't want to tell me,

31:23.510 --> 31:24.180
I won't ask you.

31:25.030 --> 31:25.620
Asking too many questions brings trouble

31:25.920 --> 31:26.940
in this martial world.

31:28.000 --> 31:29.220
You're a wise man.

31:31.070 --> 31:31.940
My surname's Lei.

31:33.110 --> 31:33.770
Lei...

31:35.720 --> 31:36.290
Lei?

31:37.790 --> 31:38.810
Lei as in Lei Fortress?

31:39.720 --> 31:40.330
That's right.

31:41.030 --> 31:41.570
The Lei Fortress

31:41.590 --> 31:42.900
never gets along with the Tang Clan.

31:43.880 --> 31:45.380
Causing them trouble now and then

31:45.400 --> 31:46.010
sounds fun to me.

31:46.400 --> 31:47.700
You're their enemy,

31:48.510 --> 31:49.620
so I saved you.

31:53.070 --> 31:54.490
You saved the right man, then.

31:54.960 --> 31:57.290
If I make it out alive this time,

31:58.590 --> 32:00.250
I'll be sure to give them some trouble

32:01.200 --> 32:02.330
to repay your kindness.

32:11.300 --> 32:13.580
[Refined Brew, Serene Mind]

32:19.270 --> 32:20.380
Those are Soul-Calling Paper Butterflies.

32:20.880 --> 32:21.980
Soul-Calling Paper Butterflies...

32:23.240 --> 32:24.220
That must be Master Mu.

32:24.640 --> 32:25.220
Yes.

32:25.720 --> 32:27.180
Only Master Mu

32:27.270 --> 32:28.700
can summon Soul-Calling Paper Butterflies.

32:28.960 --> 32:29.810
When one appears,

32:30.200 --> 32:31.220
the underworld gates open

32:31.440 --> 32:32.460
and ten thousand butterflies follow.

32:33.200 --> 32:34.980
Mu Qingyang resorted to this Soul-Calling Paper Butterfly.

32:35.590 --> 32:36.140
Looks like

32:36.640 --> 32:37.290
he...

32:38.070 --> 32:39.090
That's good news.

32:39.920 --> 32:41.090
Mu Qingyang is still alive.

32:41.750 --> 32:43.460
But the bad news is

32:44.000 --> 32:44.660
Mu Qingyang

32:45.310 --> 32:46.250
is about to perish.

32:47.400 --> 32:48.220
Let it lead us there.

32:48.880 --> 32:49.460
Sure.

32:55.640 --> 32:56.700
Wait for me here.

33:09.240 --> 33:10.420
May I know your name, mister?

33:10.960 --> 33:11.530
I must remember

33:12.030 --> 33:12.810
the favor you've shown me.

33:13.920 --> 33:14.900
My name is Lei Yunhe.

33:16.480 --> 33:17.530
It's the Twin Cranes of Lei Clan.

33:18.400 --> 33:18.770
I've heard of you.

33:19.110 --> 33:19.620
What an honor.

33:20.350 --> 33:21.730
I have some business to attend to,

33:22.070 --> 33:23.290
so I must go now.

33:23.830 --> 33:24.940
I hope you

33:25.000 --> 33:26.140
will cause them trouble

33:26.720 --> 33:27.570
as promised.

33:28.400 --> 33:28.810
Li.

33:29.550 --> 33:30.180
Let's go.

33:35.880 --> 33:37.010
What an interesting man.

34:21.190 --> 34:22.980
The Umbrella Ghost of the Blood River.

34:24.070 --> 34:24.650
Who would've thought

34:24.760 --> 34:26.090
I'd run into you here?

34:26.670 --> 34:28.460
Elder Tang Tianlu of the Tang Clan.

34:29.670 --> 34:30.460
We've met before.

34:31.190 --> 34:32.210
Is this how

34:33.360 --> 34:34.460
the Tang Clan

34:34.550 --> 34:35.570
greet its guests?

34:40.030 --> 34:42.090
Who would ever mistake the Umbrella Ghost of the Blood River

34:42.190 --> 34:43.300
for a guest?

34:44.510 --> 34:45.210
It's said

34:46.190 --> 34:47.260
that you often appear

34:47.360 --> 34:48.570
on cold, rainy nights.

34:49.360 --> 34:51.050
Like how an underworld reaper

34:52.550 --> 34:53.900
or a wandering soul would do.

35:13.460 --> 35:16.940
♪Like fate, winding with the tide♪

35:16.980 --> 35:20.860
♪Who can ford this river of night?♪

35:22.700 --> 35:26.180
♪Where's the far shore we chase all our lives?♪

35:26.220 --> 35:30.060
♪Surrendering all hues for a glimmer of light♪

35:32.060 --> 35:35.340
♪Through joy and sorrow♪

35:35.460 --> 35:37.540
♪Still I can't let go♪

35:37.700 --> 35:41.140
♪Longing keeps me awake at night♪

35:41.620 --> 35:43.820
♪My heart no longer my own♪

35:43.940 --> 35:48.940
♪No one can escape from love♪

36:05.540 --> 36:09.260
♪How many hidden feelings♪

36:09.380 --> 36:13.460
♪Sink in silence deep?♪

36:14.700 --> 36:18.580
♪Searching through the endless nights♪

36:18.700 --> 36:22.940
♪Struggling on the edge of love and pain♪

36:24.060 --> 36:26.940
♪Shadows crossing shadows♪

36:27.020 --> 36:31.260
♪Whose name hides in your eyes?♪

36:33.540 --> 36:37.540
♪When the wind blows, ask not when I shall return♪

36:37.580 --> 36:41.020
♪Ask not when I shall return♪

36:42.540 --> 36:45.980
♪Like fate, winding with the tide♪

36:46.060 --> 36:49.860
♪Who can ford this river of night?♪

36:51.780 --> 36:55.220
